title: "workflow-radar: friction, AI-suitability, and Monte Carlo ROI scoring for business workflows"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: McRae
    given-names: Sean
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-07"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/seanmcrae/workflow-radar"
url: "https://seanmcrae.github.io/workflow-radar/"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool that scores business workflows for friction and AI suitability,
  recommends a delivery pattern with guardrails, estimates ROI as a P10/P50/P90 range with a
  seeded Monte Carlo simulation, and writes a prioritized AI roadmap.
keywords:
  - ai-strategy
  - workflow-analysis
  - roi
  - monte-carlo
  - prioritization
